{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-south-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"south-bay-dubai-south-dubai-south","about":"South Bay is a fully designed residential complex by Dubai South developer. The condominium is built around one of the world's largest airports, Al Maktoum International Airport, offering a fully integrated living experience of premium-level residences. It consists of five clusters with over 1200 townhouses and villas, ranging from three to seven bedrooms and featuring fully equipped kitchens. The interior finishes are in tranquil light tones using materials of exceptionally high quality. Villas are positioned around a stunning three-kilometer lagoon with crystal-clear water.Residents of South Bay can enjoy meticulously crafted luxury amenities aimed at promoting health and wellness. These include a spa center, a meditation garden, a gym, and equipped jogging tracks. The beach club offers various water activities, including kayaking. The turquoise lagoon serves as the main attraction and meeting point for residents.The convenient location of South Bay condominium near Expo Road allows quick access to major attractions and shopping malls in Dubai.","price":11000000,"title":"South Bay","bitrix":{"id":630,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"South Bay","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Dubai South","project_location":null},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1708/images/2024/04/24/340x252/oqQN2YZ7PyJH7aRRyC77PLuZ2egAUyUcXyAN134N.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1708/images/2024/04/24/464x312/oqQN2YZ7PyJH7aRRyC77PLuZ2egAUyUcXyAN134N.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":24.9489657,"lng":55.2003509},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1708/images/2024/04/24/340x252/QfdeJtFnlT81uFSUE